        "Emily": "This gift is fabulous! Thank you so much!/60 62 64 66 68 70 241 428 440 ParrotEgg/Thank you! I'm feeling a positive energy from this gift./18 82 84 86 196 200 207 230 235 402 418/Sorry, @. I don't like this./78 232 233 225 226/This gift has a strong negative energy. I can't stand it./212 213 227 228/Thanks!//",
