        "Jodi": "Oh, you're such a sweetheart! I really love this!/72 200 211 214 220 222 225 231/Thank you! This makes my day really special./-5 -6 -79 18 402 418/Hmm, well I guess I could always put this in the compost.../-81 80 248 330/*Blech*... I hate this.../18 22 396/That's so nice of you! Thanks.//",
        "Kent": "Oh...! Mom used to give me this when I was a young boy. It brings back wonderful memories. Thank you./607 649/Hey, now this is a really great gift. Thanks./-5 -79 18 402 418 Book_Bombs/Ah... It's a... what is this, exactly? Hmm.../80 330 416 873/This... They gave this to me in Gotoro prison camp. I've been trying to forget about that. *shudder*/-6 227 229 456/That's kind of you. The family will like this.//",
