        "Gus": "You're giving this... to me? I'm speechless./72 213 635 729 907/Oh, goodness! Are you sure?/348 303 -7 18 430/No, no, no.../16 330/This is absolute junk. I'm offended./80 167 648/Oh, that's sweet. Thank you.//",
        "Dwarf": "Hey, I really love this stuff. You can find great things in the mines./554 60 62 64 66 68 70 749 162/Ah, this reminds me of home./78 82 84 86 96 97 98 99 121 122/Hmm... Is this what humans like?/-5 16 -81 330/I don't care what species you are. This is worthless garbage.//An offering! Thank you./-6 -28/",
