        "Krobus": "This is an amazing gift. For my people it is a great honor to receive something like this./72 16 276 337 305 308 879 Book_Void/Thank you very much./66 265 336 340 203/Humans have... interesting tastes./-7 -81 330/Oh... Um. I guess I'll accept it.//Thank you.//",
